        dedicated to Oscar


        - added this intro
        text print

        - lowered the difficulty by removing dissapearing pieces,
        moving ther respawn point to where you fell off, and made the narration pause
        between each sentence until you catch up

        - added a pause meny (press
        esc to try it)

        - added a thought writing levitator at the end of
        the level.'
